  "id": "itch",
  "term": "itch",
  "definition": "Itch is an unpleasant bodily sensation, commonly seen in skin conditions such as eczema, that varies in perceived severity and can be rated by the person experiencing it. In this context, it is treated as a sensory experience that may be eased by certain kinds of gentle touch.",
